OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CPM declines meeting with Stormont      
OL,5,Cministers over budget stalemate        
OL,6,GThe Prime Minister Andy Burnham has    
OL,7,Gturned down a request from Northern    
OL,8,GIreland's first and deputy first       
OL,9,Gministers for a meeting over           
OL,10,GStormont's budget stalemate.           
OL,12,FMichelle O'Neill and Emma Little-      
OL,13,FPengelly jointly wrote to the prime    
OL,14,Fminister seeking the direct engagement 
OL,15,Fin a bid to resolve the seven-month    
OL,16,Fimpasse.                               
OL,18,FBut it is understood the prime         
OL,19,Fminister has backed Northern Ireland   
OL,20,FSecretary Sir Chris Bryant continuing  
OL,21,Fto lead talks on behalf of the         
OL,22,Fgovernment.                       G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
