OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CPat Finucane a victim of state-        
OL,5,Csponsored murder, inquiry hears        
OL,6,GPat Finucane was the victim of a UK    
OL,7,G"state-sponsored murder", a lawyer     
OL,8,Gacting for the solicitor's family has  
OL,9,Gtold the public inquiry into the       
OL,10,Gloyalist murder.                       
OL,12,FDanny Friedman KC told the inquiry it  
OL,13,Fmust answer "how far up the chain of   
OL,14,Fcommand" the killing went.             
OL,16,FThe 39-year-old solicitor was shot at  
OL,17,Fhis home in north Belfast by the       
OL,18,FUlster Defence Association (UDA) in    
OL,19,Ffront of his wife and children in      
OL,20,FFebruary 1989.                         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
