OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'There was no warning sign' - calls    
OL,5,Cfor more education to reduce suicide   
OL,6,Cin men and boys                        
OL,7,GA father whose son died by suicide on  
OL,8,Gthe day after his 22nd birthday has    
OL,9,Gcalled for more education on how men   
OL,10,Gand boys can seek help during a mental 
OL,11,Ghealth crisis.                         
OL,13,FSeamus Waites said there was "no       
OL,14,Fwarning sign whatsoever" before his    
OL,15,Fson Thomas took his own life in May    
OL,16,F2016, just hours after he went out to  
OL,17,Fcelebrate with friends.                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
